            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, abantu boona nubwo baarugire aho, buli muntu yakwata ogw'owabu, Daudi na uwe yataaha, kusabira eka ye omugisa.",
          "type": "text",
